      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932826625772589446",
      "text": "[4:43PM] #IkoyiObalende #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic along the Awolowo Road corridor, both inbound and outbound, extending to Onikan Roundabout, is currently flowing smoothly.\nHowever, commuters should anticipate moderate congestion in the Falomo area. Specifically, the inbound lanes of Boudillion Road, the Alexandre Road link bridge, and Alexandre Roundabout towards Gerrard Roundabout are experiencing increased traffic volume due to the evening rush hour.\n\nAlfred Rewane Road, particularly the stretch near the Registry and NNPC heading towards Golden Gate, is also experiencing some congestion, primarily attributed to alternation. \nConversely, traffic movement remains good from Golden Gate, intersecting with Bayo Kuku Road and continuing inbound towards Osborne Foreshore. This favorable flow extends across Dolphin Bridge into Ilubirin and onto the Third Mainland Bridge at this time.\n\nFinally, the Obalende Bridge and its immediate surroundings are currently reporting smooth traffic conditions.\nNo immediate road impediments have been observed, and our officers are present to manage the flow as needed.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
