      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932829167273324713",
      "text": "[4:51PM] #EbuteEro #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic flow descending from CMS Bridge towards Offin Canal is currently slow due to ongoing market activities and a high volume of pedestrian. However, immediately after the Offin Canal, the movement towards Eko Bridge by the NEPA office is good.\n\nOn Eko Bridge, traffic flow from the NEPA area heading towards CMS Bridge is smooth.\nVehicular movement descending Eko Bridge towards Elegbeta Mini Stadium and Ebute-Ero Market is presently good.\n\nCommuters descending from Carter Bridge towards Ebute-Ero Market and continuing along Leventis through UBA Roundabout to connect both inner and outer Marina is also experiencing good traffic flow.\n\nThere is currently slow movement reported on Broad Street, extending to Apongbon underneath the bridge, where it connects to the Offin Canal market area.\nAt this time, no traffic impediments have been reported, and personnel are on ground to manage traffic situation effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
